      "content": "i dont know what to do anymore. everything is falling apart so fast it doesnt even feel real. i lost my job at the firm last month—just a sudden termination with no explanation, which is weird for someone with my record. then my bank account got flagged for \"suspicious activity\" and frozen, and now i cant even find my passport when i need it. even my neighbors... they used to be friendly but now they just stare or move away when i walk by. i keep telling myself its just a string of bad luck but the timing is so weird. does that sound crazy?",
